.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt LLAMA-CTL 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm llama-ctl
.Nd manage local llama.cpp chat and embedding servers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Fl -json
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width model-download
.It Cm install , Cm start , Cm stop , Cm restart , Cm status , Cm health , Cm logs
Manage the chat server.
.Pp
.Cm status Fl -json
reports launchd state, HTTP health, and loopback socket presence separately.
.Cm healthy
means the
.Pa /health
endpoint answered, not merely that the port is listening.
.It Cm validate , Cm config
Validate or print resolved configuration.
.It Cm model-list , Cm model-download , Cm model-switch , Cm model-prune , Cm model-df , Cm model-verify
Manage model files.
.It Cm install-embed , Cm start-embed , Cm stop-embed , Cm status-embed
Manage the embedding server.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_AI_MODELS_DIR
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_PROFILE
Active model profile.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODELS_DIR
Model storage root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODEL_FILE
Override active model file.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width etc/ai-models.yaml
.It Pa etc/ai-models.yaml
Model and server configuration.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.llama-server.plist
Chat server launchd agent.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.llama-embed.plist
Embedding server launchd agent.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ai-stack 7 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8
